2663 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Mission  Why it exists today\050Dear CC\031s mission is to help people build meaningful\054 resilient careers in the age of AI\054 through honest conversations\054 insider knowledge\054 and clear\054 practical guidance\056\n\n\nVision Where it is headed\050We envision a world where people understand how the world of work is changing\054 have access to honest guidance\054 and feel empowered to build careers that are meaningful\054 resilient\054 and aligned with who they are\056)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 2664 0 R
     /Pg 352 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
