2667 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Primary\072\nGen Z and early\055career individuals navigating an uncertain job market and looking for clear\054 honest guidance on how to build a career in the age of AI\056\n\nSecondary\072\nEducators\054 employers\054 policymakers\054 and organizations working on the future of work who want a clearer picture of how technology is reshaping career paths and opportunity\056\n\nFuture audience\072\nAnyone navigating career transitions in a world where technology is rapidly changing how we work\056)
     /K [ 2 ]
