2676 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Credible and honest\054 grounded in real industry experience\056 dear CC combines insider knowledge\054 real data\054 and real career stories to explain clearly what is happening and why it matters\054 so people feel informed and confident\056\n\nHow it should feel\072\050Clear\054 intelligent\054 credible\054 and real\056 The design should feel thoughtful\054 well structured\054 and trustworthy\054 while still feeling modern and accessible\054 not corporate and not overly polished\056 Authenticity is critical\056 The brand should be built on real stories\054 real examples\054 real people\054 and real insight\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 2677 0 R
     /Pg 816 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
