2680 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Human\054 supportive\054 and optimistic\056 dear CC is built for people who feel lost\054 overlooked\054 or unsure about their future\054 and speaks to them with respect\054 empathy\054 and encouragement\054 so people feel seen and supported as they navigate their careers\056\n\nHow it should feel\072\050 Human\054 warm\054 approachable\054 optimistic\054 respectful\054 and encouraging\056 The brand should feel like it understands what people are going through and is on their side\056 The tone should meet people where they are\054 whether they feel confused\054 behind\054 underestimated\054 or unsure\054 and help them feel capable and hopeful about what comes next\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 2681 0 R
     /Pg 816 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
