2684 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Practical\054 clear\054 and useful\056 dear CC turns complex changes in technology and the economy into guidance people can actually use\054 what skills to build\054 what roles to explore\054 and what steps to take next\054 so people feel empowered and inspired to move forward\056\n\nHow it should feel\072\050 Clear\054 practical\054 structured\054 and useful\056 The content and design should help people understand what to do next through guides\054 frameworks\054 steps\054 and resources\056 The goal is not just to explain the future of work\054 but to help people navigate it with clear direction\056)
     /K [ 7 ]
     /P 2685 0 R
     /Pg 816 0 R
