2687 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Tone of Voice\n\nClear \023 Explains complex ideas in simple\054 understandable language\056\nDirect \023 Honest and straightforward\054 without jargon or corporate language\056\nIntelligent \023 Insightful and informed\054 but never hard to understand\056\nWarm \023 Human\054 respectful\054 and empathetic\056\nPractical \023 Focused on what people can actually do next\056\n\ndear CC should sound like someone who understands how the industry works\054 understands what you\031re going through\054 and is giving you honest\054 practical advice about what to do next\056 Not corporate\056 Not academic\056 Not fluffy\056 Not doom\055driven\056)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 2688 0 R
     /Pg 950 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
