2690 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Visual Direction\n\ndear CC should feel like a modern media platform built around a trusted voice\056 It sits at the intersection of editorial content\054 personal storytelling\054 and clear data\056\n\nThe visual style should feel intelligent and trustworthy\054 but also human\054 modern\054 and accessible\056 It should feel closer to a smart publication or newsletter than to a corporate website or a tech startup\056\n\nThe brand should feel intelligent but human\054 modern but trustworthy\054 and structured but approachable\056 Crisp\054 Real\054 Human)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 2691 0 R
     /Pg 1122 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
