2697 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The dear CC logo is designed to feel intelligent\054 modern\054 and editorial\054 balancing credibility with warmth\056 It should feel clear\054 confident\054 and highly legible across digital applications\056\n\nThe logo reflects the brand\031s position at the intersection of human advice and the AI age\056 The brackets add structure and distinction\054 giving the mark a subtle sense of system\054 signal\054 and relevance\056\n\nUsed consistently\054 the logo helps dear CC feel recognizable\054 trustworthy\054 and contemporary across the website\054 social\054 presentations\054 and brand materials\056\n\n\034d\035 is dear should always be lowercase\056)
     /K [ 2 ]
     /P 2698 0 R
