2712 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The dear CC typography system is designed to feel editorial\054 intelligent\054 and highly readable across digital platforms\056 The combination of serif and sans\055serif typefaces creates a balance between authority and accessibility \024 reflecting dear CC\031s position at the intersection of human insight and the AI age\056\n\nCanela \024 Logo Only\050Canela is used exclusively for the dear CC logo and wordmark\056 Its elegant\054 modern serif forms give the brand a distinctive and recognizable voice\056 Canela should not be used for body copy or long passages of text\056\n\nPlayfair Display \024 Headlines \046 Quotes\050Playfair Display Medium is used for headlines and italicized quotes\056 This typeface brings an editorial\054 publishing\055inspired feel to the brand\054 similar to a modern magazine or journal\056 It should be used for\072\nPage headlines\nSection titles\nPull quotes\nEditorial moments and featured statements\n\nInter \024 Body Copy\050Inter is used for all body copy and interface text\056 It is highly legible on screens and ensures clarity across articles\054 data\054 navigation\054 and UI elements\056 Inter should be used for\072\nParagraph text\nNavigation\nButtons\nLabels\nCaptions\nData and charts\nAll UI and product text)
     /K [ 4 ]
     /P 2713 0 R
     /Pg 1799 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

