  << /ActualText (Human advice for the AI age\056\n\ndear CC is a platform for honest career advice\054 real stories\054 and clear data about how technology is changing the job market\056 It is built for people who want to understand what is happening\054 what it means for their future\054 and what they can do next\056\n\nGrounded in real industry experience and a deeply human approach\054 dear CC exists to help people navigate change\054 find direction\054 and build meaningful careers in a new economy\056)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 2806 0 R
     /Pg 2661 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

